# Starship Enterprise: landfall puts four charge counters on it (CR 603.6a), and Bot2's land entering adds none (CR 109.5).
# Station taps a creature for charge counters equal to its power (CR 702.184a): at twelve counters a Grizzly Bears of power 2
# takes it to fourteen and one Llanowar Elves of power 1 to fifteen - still only an artifact, not a creature - and the second
# Elves to sixteen, where it is a 4/6 artifact creature with flying in addition to its other types (CR 721.2a-b). Turn 7 that
# flier is blocked by a Wind Drake, so its combat damage is dealt to a creature and nothing is drawn (CR 120.3, 609.3); turn 9
# it gets through to the player and draws exactly the four damage it dealt (CR 121.1).

